            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JAS.4.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yak 4:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.39.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Sab 39:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naarai iŋai ejeŋi luibusakinito etuŋanan kaijarake, apaarasia kere nukaijarake naatai nuebusio kwape etoribe? Naarai iŋai epedori alimokin etuŋanan nuejaunos atupanakin ŋes kokwap kakoloŋ?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.12",
